{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021152124287-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021163939\"/><p>關員發現電動代步車行駛遲緩。</p><p>上周二(13日)上午8時許香港男子王某利用電動代步車輪胎藏匿20千克銀粒。他經拱北口岸進入珠海，現場關員發現王某神情緊張，電動代步車行駛遲緩，遂截查。關員從車輛後輪胎內查獲用黑色橡膠布綁藏的16包銀粒，共20千克。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:59:27.977453+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:21:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:38:02.296234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:57:51.525134+00:00","content_hash":"9f746ee1f9e663b4de995b11c121d6a16d5d74938060f445d5352569ff7b2432","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}